{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 阳台园艺 (balcony gardening) - focused on home plant care, planting methods, growth principles. Explicitly NOT interested in flower shop operations or garden engineering quotes.\n- Working set: 120 candidates exposed\n\nLet me review the candidates. The interest description explicitly excludes content about 花店经营 (flower shop operations) or 庭院工程报价 (garden engineering quotes). Looking at the candidates, many have content types like \"市场观察\" (market observation) which discuss 花店节日定价、商业景观工程报价与苗木批发渠道 (flower shop holiday pricing, commercial landscape engineering quotes, nursery wholesale channels) - these are exactly what the user is NOT interested in.\n\nAlso \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) content discusses 植物命名史、园林审美流派与城市展览 (plant naming history, garden aesthetic schools, city exhibitions) - these are more cultural/historical, less about home plant care.\n\nThe user's interest is about home plant care, planting methods, growth principles. So the most relevant content types would be:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - practical care steps\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - growth principles\n- 概念速览 (concept overviews) - concepts\n\nThe \"市场观察\" (market observation) content is explicitly excluded per the interest description (花店经营/庭院工程报价). The \"专题观察\" content about naming history, garden aesthetics, exhibitions is less aligned with home plant care.\n\nLet me identify the relevant candidates. The interest is 阳台园艺 (balcony gardening). The candidates span various settings: 半阴窗台, 朝南阳台, 通风露台, 夏季室内. The user's interest is about balcony gardening specifically.\n\nLet me focus on candidates that are about home plant care methods and principles, and avoid market observation content.\n\nLet me count the candidates and categorize. Given the large number, I need to select 20 that best match the interest.\n\nThe i